{"title":"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/e/7ae90d71491f591ab5a16d19ee7629e8226ec9ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> be the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> terms of the arithmetic sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/5/f854890e3d4d98f97c90703eee579cfe2cac9a6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8,12,\\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"63\" height=\"16\" /> and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/6/bb6c5ddfd368673c178f3323ce2994cdbc8fbdab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> be the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> terms of the arithmetic sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/d/d2deb41a739fe60463ed8c26f7d599c92ad76d7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17,19,\\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"72\" height=\"16\" />. Assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/1/d91275af70c9ea85ffc4c1243f835f515c9203e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\ne 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/9/9e9d58bf979212d3e93b3657b956bab186fcfb50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_1=s_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"54\" height=\"10\" /> for:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/a/c9a38de30412340091805d1954771b164f9c7582.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) no value of } n \\quad \\text{(B) one value of } n \\quad \\text{(C) two values of } n \\quad \\text{(D) four values of } n \\quad \\text{(E) more than four values of } n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"836\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/c/13c3218ca790f4eac4048f34f68433655b19e1f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME\" title=\"1966 AHSME\">1966 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1966 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&am